<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Mada Asahaka (feat. WANUKA)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Biteki Keikaku"/><amll:meta key="album" value="BITEKI"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPWP02200260"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1612464701"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="176552149"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Zennmn"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Enon Kawatani</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">还是回去吧 明天还要上班呢</text><text for="L2">请察觉这并非我的真心</text><text for="L3">看到这一幕果然会哭呢 我也是啊</text><text for="L4">请别察觉我只是在掩饰</text><text for="L5">真想回到被你步步紧逼的那时候</text><text for="L6">曾毫不犹豫地把客服般的嗓音压低两度</text><text for="L7">仍然浅薄 我如此浅薄</text><text for="L8">奋力一跃还来得及吗</text><text for="L9">还是天真 我依然天真</text><text for="L10">闭着双眼将这份喜欢</text><text for="L11">诉说</text><text for="L12">你果然很体贴呢 真像身在温暖的茧中</text><text for="L13">事后才出拳 却还是输了</text><text for="L14">果然？太迟了吗 明天也没什么要做的了</text><text for="L15">这一次却是发自真心</text><text for="L16">不要 不要 还不想</text><text for="L17">我脑海中所想的你的心里</text><text for="L18">盼着装的就是你脑海之外的我</text><text for="L19">若始终只是这样</text><text for="L20">仍然浅薄 我如此浅薄</text><text for="L21">奋力一跃还来得及吗</text><text for="L22">还是天真 我依然天真</text><text for="L23">闭着双眼说喜欢你</text><text for="L24">仍然浅薄 我如此浅薄</text><text for="L25">泪湿枕边 独自低吟</text><text for="L26">还是天真 我依然天真</text><text for="L27">只消一眼便能明白</text><text for="L28">不要</text><text for="L29">明明只剩下执着未了的心事</text><text for="L30">如此浅薄 我如此浅薄</text><text for="L31">奋力一跃还来得及吗</text><text for="L32">还是天真 我依然天真</text><text for="L33">闭着双眼说喜欢你</text><text for="L34">不过一句话 却又如此沉重</text><text for="L35">只因以为不言自明 我才</text><text for="L36">至今浅薄 因此浅薄</text><text for="L37">闭着双眼说喜欢你</text><text for="L38">依然</text><text for="L39">如此浅薄 我如此浅薄</text><text for="L40">即使跃起你也不会察觉吗</text><text for="L41">还是天真 我依然天真</text><text for="L42">睁开双眼向你诉说</text><text for="L43">此刻</text></translation></translations><transliterations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn" xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"><text for="L1"><span begin="0:20.143" end="0:20.413">yap</span><span begin="0:20.413" end="0:20.783">pa </span><span begin="0:20.933" end="0:21.243">kae</span><span begin="0:21.243" end="0:21.643">rou </span><span begin="0:21.643" end="0:21.893">ka</span><span begin="0:21.893" end="0:22.143">na </span><span begin="0:22.253" end="0:22.783">ashita </span><span begin="0:22.903" end="0:23.103">shi</span><span begin="0:23.103" end="0:23.483">goto </span><span begin="0:23.483" end="0:23.693">a</span><span begin="0:23.693" end="0:23.903">ru </span><span begin="0:23.903" end="0:24.143">shi</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="0:24.143" end="0:24.483">t te </span><span begin="0:24.613" end="0:25.103">shin </span><span begin="0:25.103" end="0:25.253">ka</span><span begin="0:25.253" end="0:25.383">ra </span><span begin="0:25.383" end="0:25.653">ja </span><span begin="0:25.653" end="0:25.983">nai </span><span begin="0:25.983" end="0:26.293">no </span><span begin="0:26.663" end="0:27.113">ki</span><span begin="0:27.113" end="0:27.263">zu</span><span begin="0:27.263" end="0:27.373">i</span><span begin="0:27.373" end="0:27.753">te</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="0:28.182" end="0:28.442">yap</span><span begin="0:28.442" end="0:28.772">pa </span><span begin="0:28.982" end="0:29.222">na i</span><span begin="0:29.222" end="0:29.442">cha</span><span begin="0:29.512" end="0:29.692">u </span><span begin="0:29.692" end="0:29.952">y